# Phase 5 test asset: materials for assets/models/scene.obj.
#
# None of these reference a texture image (no map_Kd) -- Model's material
# loader (src/model.cpp) falls back to the engine's default checker texture
# for any material with no diffuse texture, modulated by that material's Kd
# as its tint, so each object below still renders in its own distinct color
# even though all three share the same fallback texture image.

newmtl Table
Kd 0.55 0.35 0.15
Ka 0.55 0.35 0.15
Ks 0.20 0.20 0.20
Ns 16.0

newmtl Box
Kd 0.15 0.35 0.75
Ka 0.15 0.35 0.75
Ks 0.30 0.30 0.30
Ns 48.0

newmtl Pyramid
Kd 0.75 0.15 0.15
Ka 0.75 0.15 0.15
Ks 0.30 0.30 0.30
Ns 32.0
